###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Errors are stated only approximately (e.g. graphene with 100 samples: about 1 meV (0.02 meV/atom) energy and about 6 meV/A force MAE; Pd about 10 meV/A with about 70 samples) or as learning curves (Figs. 2-3); not encoded. Phonon RMSEs (0.85, 0.35, 0.38 meV) are properties.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/sauceda2022.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
